## Angular production build copied into the Api image at Docker build time (src/EmotePurge.Api/Dockerfile); never committed
src/EmotePurge.Api/wwwroot/

# Impeccable design-skill scratch: PIDs, ports, heartbeats, question answers.
# Machine-local runtime state; the durable decisions live in docs/DECISIONS.md
# and the direction contract in web/src/index.html.
.impeccable/

# Superpowers working directory per plan: ledger, task briefs, reports, review packages.
# Session scratch — the durable trace of a plan is its commits and the plan file
# under docs/superpowers/plans/.
.superpowers/

# Angular CLI cache when ng runs from the repo root instead of from web/ (web/.gitignore only covers web/.angular/cache).
.angular/

# Bind-mount target of the `harness` compose service (#69): JSONL log and markdown report
# of an accuracy run. Fetched from the VPS via scp, never committed.
harness-reports/

# Bind-mount target of the `api` service's Legal:ContentPath (issue #247): operator-supplied
# imprint/privacy Markdown. The repo is public and self-hostable, so it must never carry the
# original operator's legal text — see docs/Operations.md "Legal pages".
legal-content/
